senses.gloss:
(1) PREMNA INTEGRIFOLIA LINN. (Ainslie 2, p. 210-211; Avk; Bpn,
p. 281-282: बृहदग्निमन्थ; Chopra, Ind. drugs; Dutt; DWH 3, p.
66-68; HK; KB 3, p. 1927-1928; Nadk. 1, nr. 2025; V 1, p. 79) =
P. SPINOSA ROXB. (Avk; Dutt; HK; Kav; MW; Nadk. 1, nr. 2025;
PW; Wise) = P. SERRATIFOLIA LINN. (Avk; Dy, p. 604; Kav; KB 3,
p. 1927-1928; Nadk. 1, nr. 2025; PA 1, 2, p. 32-38; Vśs);
(2) P. LONGIFOLIA (PW: ?); the Index Kewensis mentions two spe-
cies of this name, both occurring in India: a) P. LONGIFOLIA ROXB.,
b) P. BENGALENSIS C. B. CLARKE = P. LONGIFOLIA WALL.;
(3) P. LATIFOLIA ROXB. (PA 1, 2, p. 32: used as a substitute);
(4) P. CORIACEA C. B. CLARKE (PA 1, 2, p. 32: used as a substitute);
(5) CLERODENDRUM PHLOMOIDES LINN. F. (Avk; Bpn, p. 281-282:
क्षुद्राग्निमन्थ; Gul; IRM 2, p. 232; KB 3, p. 1947-1948; Nadk. 1,
nr. 618) [= C. PHLOMIDIS LINN. F.] (IRM 2, p. 232); see about the
spelling of this name: Flora Pavagadh, p. 187;
(6) C. INERME GAERTN. (Avk; DWH 3, p. 76-79: = क्षुद्राग्निमन्थ
acc. to some; Nadk. 1, nr. 616: क्षुद्राग्निमन्थ);
(7) C. NEREIFOLIUM WALL. (Nadk. 1, nr. 616: क्षुद्राग्निमन्थ) =
C. INERME R. BR.
